<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 JOHAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 JOHAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Jo</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHAN</para>
  <para style="mt2">CCAKY KYKHEITNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 John</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Johan Ccaky Kykheitnaw</char> nynh paccynnaw ccangning a hoi: a ccawriatu hae kha Pachia te a Ccapaw Jesu Khri ryte vaeccawkunaw hoite a hiin nawlan hae tuhounaw te tuh-e vaeccawkunaw a rosah khotu ahme leipaw ccangpyanaw a um keiccuze raeringnaw a pya hae. Tuh-e ahme leipaw ccangpyanaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: hynh-e laephi tuh eih a sei keiccuze laephi te a kyngkuh hae paw balyn tuh marya a sei hae, tukeiccuze Pachia Ccapaw Jesu tuh ccungccaw ccaccing a la thua lanze a seipaw athuabua cih keiccuze ccungccaw ccaccing tuh thua khyh. Hynhcite ccangpahtu hae nynh tuh khumnaw ccounaw elang hynh-e laephi te ah phiaku oh ho zah, ziazae hoynaw, sungsakunaw te kharouh sekuh khyh, a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hynh-e ccangpyanaw te a rawsekuh lante ccawzeitu nynh a langsahkupaw tuh: Jesu Khri tuh ccungccaw ccaccing thua zah, Jesu a zynpaw te Pachia a sungsahpaw balyn tuh lu kheit te lu kheit a sungsakuh hahe cih hae, cite a ho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Awnaw te mohnaw — 1.5—2.29</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia ccaaw hae te Satan ccaaw hae — 3.1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Byaccing te hynpaw — 4.1-6</para>
  <para style="io1">Sungsakunaw rya — 4.7-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Taetu zynnaw — 5.1-21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Athotakawnaw kyate a um vae paw, kaening nynh kae thaepaw, kae mit te kae muihpaw, hoyte kae do zah kae kuih te phe kae haetuapaw hiinnaw Bya te asekuhpaw uccaw kha kae hopya oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e hiinnaw tuh yn langkuh vae, kaening nynh kae muih zah ccaekia kae khan vae; Paaw ryte la um hae zah kaening kya yn langkuhpaw tuh-e zungzae hiinnaw kong tuh nae kalan kae langsahpya oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Nanning mah kaening ryte vaeccawkunaw na hoibua ccaw oh cite kae muihpaw te kae thaepaw kha kae hopya oh; kaening tuh Paaw te a Ccapaw Jesu Khri ryte vaeccawkunaw kae hoi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae lungtuanaw accing nawlan kaening nynh hynh-e hae hynh nae kalan kae zei.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia tuh Awnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaw kyate kae thae zah nae kalan kae hopya oh paw bya tuh hynh-e nynh thua: Pachia tuh awnaw thua zah amaw kya mohnaw kharouh um khyh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aening nynh amaw ryte vaeccawkunaw ah hoi oh cite ah ho oh zah mohnaw kya ah um oh ze, ah hyn oh paw thua zah byaccing kya ah hiin khyh oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia tuh awnaw kya a um hawte, aening nynh awnaw kya ah um oh ze, aening tuh lu kheit te lu kheit vaeccawkunaw ah hoi oh zah, a Ccapaw Jesu Khri chiise nynh seinaw balyn kyate oun thyaasah. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aening nynh seinaw ah hoi khyh oh cite ah ho oh ze, ahmaw te ahmaw ah lingkuh oh paw thua zah, byaccing tuh aening kya um khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aening nynh ah seinaw kha ah phyku oh ze, Pachia tuh a lungzipaw te a dingpaw athua keiccuze ah seinaw kha oun ngaethya cih zah dingleinaw balyn kyate oun thyaasah cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aening nynh ah sei khyh oh cite ah ho oh ze, Pachia tuh hynbya a hopaw lang ah tangsah oh zah, a bya tuh aening kya um khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri tuh Oun Bawmtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ccaaw taraw hae, nanning nynh na sei khyh ccaw oh cite hynh-e hae hynh nae kalan kae zei. Lukhakheit nynh a sei ze, aening oun bawmtupaw ah hoi oh; aning tuh Paaw ryte a umkheih hae paw adingpaw Jesu Khri nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning tuh aening seinaw hanlan seishawnaw silawnawpaw nynh thua; aening seinaw hanlan kyalya thua leite, laephi ccungccaw hae balyn mih seinaw hanlan mah athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aening nynh a kawbya hae kha ah zui oh ze, amaw kha ah ny oh cipaw phe ria lan ah ho kho oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaw kha ka nyh cite ho zah a kawbya hae a zui leipaw ccungccaw tuh mihynpaw nynh thua; tuh-e paw kya byaccing um khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama humhung zemah a bya a zuipaw tuh Pachia sungsahnaw kha a kya accing ccaccing. Hynhcite nynh aening tuh amaw kya ah um oh cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia kya ka um cite a hopaw nynh tuh Jesu Khri a hiin hawte a hiinbua aho.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kawbya Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, nae kalan kawbya thawpaw kha ka zei khyh; atakaw te na hoi vae oh paw kawbya rynpaw kha nynh ka zei. Kawbya rynpaw tuh atakaw te na thae vae oh paw bya kha nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaw kya te nanning kya ahmepaw kawbya thawpaw kha nae kalan ka zei, pawccecize mohnaw tuh zo zah ahmepaw awnaw tuh atu a aw vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Awnaw kya nynh ka um ci zah a uno kha a huapaw tuh mohnaw kya nynh a um ung. <verse number="10" style="v" />A uno a sungsahpaw tuh awnaw kya tyn zah, ccungccaw khuliasaku lanpaw kha a lungkhu kya um khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama a uno a huapaw ccungccaw tuh mohnaw kya um zah mohnaw kya nynh a ccia.Tuh-e mohnaw nynh a mit a mohsah keiccuze teilang nynh ka ccia cipaw nyhkuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, Bawipaw min liate</para>
  <para style="q2">nae seinaw kha ngaethya</para>
  <para style="q1">athua vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paaw hae, atakaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a la um vae paw amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na ny vae oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccangvae hae, Satan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tae vae oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka ccaaw hae, Paaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na ny vae oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Paaw hae, atakaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a la um vae paw amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na ny vae oh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccangvae hae, nae thawsae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia bya tuh nae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">atyn keiccuze Satan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tae vae oh, tukeiccuze</para>
  <para style="q3">nae kalan ccaw ka zei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laephi te laephi kya a umpaw uccaw hae hynh sungsah nan oh. Ccungccaw lukhakheit nynh laephi kha a sungsah ze, Paaw sungsahnaw tuh tuh-e paw kya um khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize laephi kya a umpaw uccaw hae athuapaw pynsaw rynaw, mit te rynaw, te hiinnaw kong lante lysakunaw balyn tuh Paaw kya-e thua leite, laephi kya-e nynh thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Laephi te laephi uccaw duaanaw tuh azothya; thuasalama Pachia rynaw hawte a hiinpaw ccungccaw tuh zungzae atyn.</para>
  <para style="s1">Antikhri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, atu ccyh tuh nyathyakou ccyh nynh thua. Antikhri yn thua cih cite na thae vae oh hawte, atu lya antikhri patae um vae hae; tukeiccuze atu ccyh tuh nyathyakou ccyh nynh thua cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin tuh aening kyate a pou hae, thuasalama aening te sekuh bua khyh hae; pawccecize minmin tuh aening te aseku hae ze, aening ryte po a um cih hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh a pou hae paw tuh, aening te minmin balyn tuh ah sekuh vae khyh oh cipaw a langsaku hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Athyaapaw nynh nanning kha chitui ae thuh vae oh zah, pawpaw balyn kha na ny oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning nynh byaccing kha na ny khyh oh keiccu nae kalan ccaw ka zei cipaw thua khyh. Nanning nynh byaccing kha na nyh oh zah, hynbya tuh byaccing te sekuh khyh cipaw na ny keiccu oh nynh nae kalan ccaw ka zei. <verse number="22" style="v" />Hummou mihynpaw tuh? Jesu tuh Khri thua khyh cite a eipaw ccungccaw tuh mihynpaw nynh thua. Paaw te Ccapaw kha a eipaw ccungccaw tuh antikhri nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Humhung zemah Ccapaw a eipaw ccungccaw tuh Paaw kha hoi khyh. Ccapaw kha a lehkhanpaw tuh Paaw kha mah a hoi. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atakaw te na thae vae oh paw bya kha nae kya la tynsah oh. Atakaw te na thae vae oh paw bya nynh nae kya atyn lanze, nanning mah Ccapaw kya te Paaw kya na tyn cih oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Khri nynh aening oun kinpyakupaw tuh zungzae hiinnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nanning ling lan ae ry oh paw ccungccaw hae kong te asekuhpaw hynh-e ccaw hynh nae kalan ka zei. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama Athyaapaw kyate na mue oh paw chitui thuhnaw tuh nae kya atynpaw thua zah, nanning tuh lukhakheit nynh ccangpyaku na ho vae khyh oh. Tuh-e chitui thuhnaw nynh pawpaw balyn kha nanning ae ccangpya oh, tuh-e tuh akyhpaw thua zah hynpaw thua khyh; tuh-e nynh ae ccangpya oh thyhawte nanning nynh amaw kya na tyn cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, atu Ccapaw kya la tyn oh, tuhteze tuh Ccapaw he yn langku vae ze aening nynh zynkunaw ah hoi cih oh zah, he yn thua vae ze amaw malang maethyanaw ah ccou lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khri tuh ading cipaw na ny oh ze, dingnaw a raepaw ccungccaw miakaw tuh Pachia kyate a puipaw nynh thua cipaw na ny oh.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aening tuh Pachia ccaaw hae cite ko ah thua nawlan oh, pawcihawpaw sungsahnaw mou Paaw Pachia nynh oun pya cipaw kha tuatua oh; aening tuh Pachia ccaaw hae nynh ah thua ccaccing oh. Laephi ccungccaw hae nynh Pachia kha a ny khyh hae keiccuze aening kha mah oun nyh khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Joh 1.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Sungsah hae, atu aening tuh Pachia ccaaw hae nynh ah thua oh. Nyalang aening tuh pawte nynh ah thua cih oh cipaw langkuh loh khyh. Thuasalama Khri he yn langkuh te, aening tuh amaw te loku bua lan cipaw ah ny oh; pawccecize aening nynh amaw kha athuanaw thathyhte ah muih cih oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Khri kya ngaehoinaw a hoipaw miakaw tuh Khri nynh ccipapya lan a um hawte ccipapya lan nynh a umbua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Humhung zemah a seipaw tuh kawbya a lawepaw nynh thua; seinaw tuh kawbya lawenaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Khri tuh ccungccaw seinaw cciakhae khylan nynh yn langku cipaw na ny oh, amaw kya seinaw um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:29">Joh 1.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Khri kya atynpaw miakaw tuh seinaw rae khyh; seinaw palei a raepaw miakaw tuh Khri kha muih khyh zah ny mah nyh khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, hum sanmah la lingsakuh nan oh. Khri tuh ading hawte dingnaw rya a lahpaw tuh miding nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Seinaw a raepaw ccungccaw tuh Satan kya-e nynh thua, pawccecize Satan tuh atakaw te palei a seipaw nynh thua. Pachia Ccapaw yn langkupaw tuh Satan ryalaw kha ro khylan nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia kyate yn puipaw ccungccaw miakaw nynh tuh seinaw kha rae khyh; pawccecize Pachia ccacii kha tuh-e paw kya atyn, aning tuh Pachia kyate yn puipaw athua keiccuze sei kho khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia ccaaw hae te Satan ccaaw hae tuh hynhcite alangkuh: Humhung zemah dingnaw rya a lah leipaw te a uno a sungsah leipaw ccungccaw tuh Pachia kya-e thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Sungsakuh Oh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawccecize atakaw te na thae vae oh paw phungbya tuh hynhte nynh thua: Aening lu kheit te lu kheit sungsaku lanpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Joh 13.34</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Satan kya-e thua zah amaw a neitaw a theihpaw Kain hawte thua nan oh sih. Pawccemou a neitaw kha a chia ci ze, amaw a cyisahnaw tuh hoy khyh zah, a neitawpaw a cyisahnaw tuh ading keiccu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Gen 4.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Uteno hae, laephi ccungccaw hae nynh ae hua oh ze nae ngaeangthua nan sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aening nynh ah uno hae kha ah sungsah oh keiccuze chinaw kyate hiinnaw kalan ah thua vae oh cipaw ah ny oh. A uno a sungsah leipaw ccungccaw tuh chinaw kya nynh atyn.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Joh 5.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Humhung zemah a uno a huapaw tuh ccungccaw a theihtu nynh thua; ccungccaw a theihtupaw kya tuh zungzae hiinnaw um khyh cipaw na ny oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Khri nynh a hiinnaw kha aening hanlan a pyaku; tuhcite aening nynh Pachia sungsahnaw kha ah nythya oh; aening mah ah uno hae hanlan ah hiinnaw kha pyaku lan accan. <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw lu kheit nynh e laephi uccaw hae hynh mang a hoi pite a ryachipaw a uno kha muih zah ngaethyaumsahnaw a hoi khyh lanze, pawtemou Pachia sungsahnaw tuh tuh-e paw kya a um kho cih?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, aening nynh ah bya te kyalya, khalang te kyalya sungsaku leite cyisahnaw te thanccingte sungsakuh oh sih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh aening tuh byaccing te ah sekuh oh cipaw ah nyh cih oh zah Pachia malang ah thinlung zynkunaw ah hoi cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize ah thinlung nynh ahmaw kha sei oun be lanze, Pachia tuh aening thinlung laeze lesaehua zah pawpaw balyn kha pong a nyhpaw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, ah thinlung nynh ahmaw hynh sei oun be khyh ze, Pachia malang zynkunaw ah hoi oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aening nynh a kawbya hae kha ah zui oh zah a lungrythuapaw ryalaw hae kha ah law oh keiccuze ah ngiaku oh paw miakaw kha amaw kyate ah mue oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kawbya tuh e hynh nynh thua: Aening nynh a Ccapaw Jesu Khri min kha zyn lanpaw te Khri nynh kaw yn pya thyhawte lu kheit te lu kheit sungsaku lanpaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Joh 13.34</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15.12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Pachia kawbya a zuipaw ccungccaw tuh Pachia kya tyn zah Pachia mah tuh-e paw kya atyn. Aening oun pyapaw Thyaa Muisaw liate Pachia tuh aening kya atyn cipaw ah ny oh.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw te Ahme leipaw Muisaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, muisaw miakaw kha la zyn nan oh; muisaw hae kha Pachia kyate yn thuapaw tou, yn thua leipaw tou cipaw kha la syntawtua oh; pawccecize lingthya profeh hae patae tuh laephi vawlan oun langkuh vae hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia Muisaw tuh hynhte na nyh cih oh: Jesu Khri tuh pynsaw lante nynh yn thua cite ccaekia a khanpaw muisaw miakaw tuh Pachia kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesu Khri tuh pynsaw lante nynh yn thua cite ccaekia a khan leipaw muisaw miakaw tuh Pachia kya-e thua khyh. Tuh-e muisaw tuh antikhri kya-e nynh thua; antikhri tuh yn thua cih cite na thae vae oh hawte atu laephi kya a um vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, nanning tuh Pachia kya-e na thua oh zah minmin kha phe na tae vae oh; pawccecize nae kya a umpaw Muisaw tuh laephi kya a umpaw muisaw laeze alehua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin tuh laephi kya-e nynh athua hae, tukeiccuze minmin nynh laephi te asekuhpaw uccaw hae kong kha a hothya hae. Laephi ccungccaw hae nynh mih bya kha a ngaepya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Aening tuh Pachia kya-e nynh ah thua oh. Pachia a nyhpaw ccungccaw nynh ah bya kha a ngae. Pachia kya-e athua leipaw ccungccaw nynh tuh aening bya kha ngae khyh. Tuhcite aening nynh ahmepaw muisaw te ahynpaw muisaw kha ah ny oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia tuh Sungsakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, lu kheit te lu kheit sungsakuh oh sih, pawccecize sungsakunaw tuh Pachia kyate yn thuapaw nynh thua. Ccungccaw a sungsahpaw miakaw tuh Pachia kyate yn puipaw thua zah Pachia kha a ny. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw a sungsah leipaw tuh Pachia kha nyh khyh; pawccecize Pachia tuh sungsakunaw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh aening oun sungsahnaw alangkunawpaw tuh: Ccapaw liate aening nynh hiinnaw ah mue nawlan oh, Pachia nynh a hoi thypaw Ccapaw kha laephi vawlan yn saw. <verse number="10" style="v" />Sungsakunaw cipaw tuh: Aening nynh Pachia kha ah sungsah oh cipaw thua leite, Pachia nynh aening kha oun sungsah zah a Ccapaw kha aening seinaw ngaethyanaw elang yn saw. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sungsah hae, Pachia nynh aening hynh myarya oun sungsah lanze, aening mah lu kheit te lu kheit sungsaku lan accan. <verse number="12" style="v" />Hum nynh sanmah Pachia kha muih boi khyh. Aening nynh lu kheit te lu kheit ah sungsaku oh ze, Pachia tuh aening kya um zah, a sungsahnaw tuh aening kya accing.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:18">Joh 1.18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pachia nynh a Muisaw kha aening oun pya vae keiccuze aening tuh Pachia kya ah um oh zah Pachia tuh aening kya a um cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Paaw nynh Ccapaw kha laephi Khumtu lang yn saw cipaw kaening nynh kae muih zah ccaekia kae khan. <verse number="15" style="v" />Humhung zemah Jesu tuh Pachia Ccapaw nynh thua cite ccaekia a khanpaw tuh a kya Pachia um zah aning mah Pachia kya a um. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia nynh aening hanlan a hoipaw sungsahnaw kha aening nynh ah nyh oh zah ah zyn oh.</para>
  <para style="p">Pachia tuh sungsakunaw nynh thua; sungsakunaw kya a tynpaw ccungccaw tuh Pachia kya tyn zah, Pachia mah tuh-e paw kya atyn. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aening nynh byapia nin kya rawhoynaw ah hoi nawlan oh, sungsakunaw kha aening kya a ccingsah vae. Pawccecize e laephi vawlan aening tuh Khri hawte ah hiinbua oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Sungsakunaw kya tuh rinaw um khyh, accingpaw sungsakunaw nynh tuh rinaw kha ccaring a dee. Pawccecize rinaw tuh detahnaw te akyngkuhpaw thua zah, rinaw a hoipaw ccungccaw tuh sungsakunaw phe ccing lan hoi loh khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia nynh aening kha oun sungsah ty keiccuze aening nynh amaw kha ah sungsah oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit nynh, “Pachia ka sungsah,” ci zah, a uno kha a hua lanze, aning tuh mihynpaw nynh thua. Pawccecize phang a muihpaw a uno kha a sungsah leipaw ccungccaw nynh a muih leipaw Pachia kha pawtemou a sungsah kho cih? <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia a sungsahpaw nynh tuh a uno kha mah a sungsah hahe cih, acikuhpaw kawbya hynh Khri kyate ah mue oh.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw nynh Laephi A Tae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Humhung zemah Jesu tuh Khri nynh thua cite a zynpaw miakaw tuh Pachia ccaaw nynh thua. A saahtupaw Paaw kha a sungsahpaw miakaw nynh tuh Paaw kyate yn puipaw ccaaw kha mah a sungsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aening nynh Pachia kha ah sungsah oh zah a kawbya hae kha ah zui oh ze, Pachia ccaaw hae kha ah sungsah oh cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia sungsah cipaw tuh aening nynh a kawbya hae kha ah zui oh paw hynh nynh thua. A kawbya hae tuh phuripaw thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:15">Joh 14.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia kyate a puipaw miakaw nynh tuh laephi kha a tae. Laephi a tae khopaw taenaw tuh aening zynnaw nynh athua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Laephi a taepaw tuh hummou? Jesu tuh Pachia Ccapaw nynh thua cite a zynpaw ccungccaw kha thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Ccapaw Kong Ccaekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tui te chiise te yn thuapaw tuh Jesu Khri nynh thua. Tui te kyalya thua leite tui te chiise te nynh yn thua; ccaekia a khantupaw tuh Muisaw nynh thua, pawccecize Muisaw tuh byaccing nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize vaawlang kya ccangthum a um hae: <verse number="8" style="v" />Muisaw, tui te chiise thua hae zah tuh-e ccangthum hae tuh mih lungnging. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh ccaekia a khanpaw kha aening nynh ah lawku oh ze, Pachia ccaekia tuh houh alesaepaw nynh thua; pawccecize hynh-e tuh Pachia nynh a Ccapaw kong ccaekia a khanpaw Pachia ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia Ccapaw a zynpaw tuh a lungkhu kya ccaekia a hoi. Pachia a zyn leipaw tuh Pachia kha hynbya a hosah, pawccecize Pachia nynh a Ccapaw kong ccaekia a khanpaw kha aning nynh zyn khyh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccaekia tuh e hynh nynh thua: Pachia nynh aening kha zungzae hiinnaw oun pya vae, tuh-e hiinnaw tuh a Ccapaw kya nynh a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:36">Joh 3.36</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccapaw a hoipaw tuh hiinnaw a hoi. Pachia Ccapaw kha a hoi leipaw tuh hiinnaw hoi khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thangsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pachia Ccapaw min na zyn oh paw nanning nynh zungzae hiinnaw na hoi oh paw kha na nyku nawlan oh, hynh-e ccaw hynh nae kalan kae zei.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia kya aening rawhoynaw ah hoi oh paw tuh e hynh nynh thua: Aening nynh amaw rynaw thyhte ccangkhakheit kha ah ngiaku oh ze, Pachia nynh oun thaepya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Aening nynh ah ngiaku oh paw miakaw kha aning nynh oun thaepya cipaw ah ny oh ze, amaw kalan ah ngiaku oh paw kha ah mue oh cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Chinaw kalan a phyasah leipaw seinaw a rae cciamangpaw a uno kha lukhakheit nynh a muih lanze, a hanlan saw a sangpah cih. Chinaw kalan a phyasah leipaw seinaw a raetu hae kha Pachia nynh hiinnaw a pya cih hae. Chinaw kalan a phyasahpaw seinaw a um, tuh-e seinaw hanlan sawsangpah sah cite ka ho khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Cyiseinaw miakaw tuh seinaw nynh thua, thuasalama chinaw kalan a phyasah leipaw seinaw a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Humhung zemah Pachia kyate a puipaw tuh sei khyh cipaw ah ny oh. Pachia kyate a puipaw tuh amaw te amaw rinkuh zah, Satan nynh ty kho khyh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aening tuh Pachia kya-e nynh ah thua oh cipaw te laephi balyn tuh Satan kuih kya nynh a um cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahmepaw Pachia kha ah ny nawlan oh, Pachia Ccapaw tuh yn thua vae zah, aening kha thaethyanaw oun pya vae cipaw ah ny oh; aening tuh ahmepaw Pachia kya te a Ccapaw Jesu Khri kya nynh ah um oh. Aning tuh ahmepaw Pachia thua zah zungzae hiinnaw mah athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ccaaw hae, zohtuh hae kha la sibia oh. Amen.</para>
</usx>